SDL_HapticEffectSupported :: (haptic: *SDL_Haptic, effect: *SDL_HapticEffect) -> bool extern_C
//  Create a new haptic effect on a specified device.
//
//  \param haptic — an SDL_Haptic device to create the effect on.
